{"ID":"20240206090200-t2e1hwx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206090200-t2e1hwx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206090200-t2e1hwx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619130647-8nz4snj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607124312-k6ml1wq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619133955-8n1p3hy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"064漏芦（漏卢）","type":"doc","updated":"20240807115642"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240619130647-8nz4snj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619130647-8nz4snj","updated":"20240619130647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"祁州漏芦"}]},{"ID":"20240206090210-b5aubay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206090210-b5aubay","updated":"20240206090214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产辽宁、河北、山西等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈圆锥形或扁片块状，多扭曲，长短不一，直径1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.5cm。表面暗棕色、灰褐色或黑褐色，粗糙，具纵沟及菱形的网状裂隙。外层易剥落，根头部膨大，有残茎及鳞片状叶基，顶端有灰白色绒毛。体轻，质脆，易折断，断面不整齐，灰黄色，有裂隙，中心遥呈星状裂隙，灰黑色或棕黑色。气特异，味微苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，消痈，下乳，舒筋通脉。用于乳痈肿痛，痈疽发背，瘰疬疮毒，乳汁不通，湿痹拘挛，骨节疼痛、热毒血痢、痔疮出血。\n【注解】\t“戴斗笠”：指漏芦根头膨大，有棕色鳞片状叶基覆盖在其顶端的白毛上，如同头戴斗笠。"}]},{"ID":"20240206090204-87b1js8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206090204-87b1js8","updated":"20240206090204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206090204-9obe1h9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240619131236-y1b40gh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619131236-y1b40gh","updated":"20240807111115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 411px;","style":"width: 401px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"祁州漏芦2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/祁州漏芦2-20240619131238-8mt5j8p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 401px;\" parent-style=\"width: 411px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619130740-2jahlym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619130740-2jahlym","updated":"20240807111125"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 654px;","style":"width: 644px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"祁州漏芦"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/祁州漏芦-20240619130740-wk5z1u3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 644px;\" parent-style=\"width: 654px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 648px;","style":"width: 638px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"祁州漏芦 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/祁州漏芦 2-20240807111207-z5dyy5b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 638px;\" parent-style=\"width: 648px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807111744-0s6cwkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807111744-0s6cwkd","updated":"20240807114011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 349px;","style":"width: 339px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"祁州漏芦 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/祁州漏芦 3-20240807111744-6pupvf9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 339px;\" parent-style=\"width: 349px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 351px;","style":"width: 341px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"祁州漏芦 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/祁州漏芦 4-20240807113853-0g4lvwy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 341px;\" parent-style=\"width: 351px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 304px;","style":"width: 294px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"祁州漏芦 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/祁州漏芦 6-20240807114011-vgq5xl9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 294px;\" parent-style=\"width: 304px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 289px;","style":"width: 279px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"祁州漏芦 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/祁州漏芦 7-20240807114118-1ntcrdl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 279px;\" parent-style=\"width: 289px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240807114227-2o9xvfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807114227-2o9xvfg","updated":"20240807114327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 348px;","style":"width: 338px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"祁州漏芦 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/祁州漏芦 8-20240807114317-t3nko27.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 338px;\" parent-style=\"width: 348px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 811px;","style":"width: 801px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"祁州漏芦"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/祁州漏芦-20240807111038-je12hyl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 801px;\" parent-style=\"width: 811px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807111038-qwp9c1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807111038-qwp9c1v","updated":"20240807111038"}},{"ID":"20240206093454-pcyf7h5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093454-pcyf7h5","updated":"20240206093500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"禹州漏芦"}]},{"ID":"20240206093510-0ww24uw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093510-0ww24uw","updated":"20240206093514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产内蒙古、河南等地。\n【性状】\t呈类圆柱形，上粗下细，稍扭曲，长1030cm，直径12cm。外皮灰褐色或灰黄色，粗糙，有纵皱纹，顶端丛生棕色硬毛，为残存的叶柄维管束，下端偶有分枝。质坚，不易折断，断面外圈褐色，内有黄、黑相间的菊花纹。无臭，味微涩。以条粗、坚实者为佳。根呈类圆柱形、稍扭曲，长短不一，直径0.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.5cm。表面土黄色或灰棕色，粗糙，具纵皱纹，顶端有纤维状棕色硬毛，为残存的叶柄维管束。质坚，断面粗纤维状，皮部棕色，木部具黄黑相间的菊纹，气微，味微涩。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，排脓止血，消痈下乳。用于诸疮痈风，乳痈肿痛，乳汁不通，瘰疬疮毒。又用作驱蛔剂。\n【注解】\t“扫帚头”：指药材顶端的纤维性棕色硬毛，形如扫帚。\n“菊花心”：指药材断面木部黄黑相间的放射状纹理。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093504-foq60j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093504-foq60j6","updated":"20240206093504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093504-g0y8kf0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240619131847-92rsiu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619131847-92rsiu3","updated":"20240619131937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 658px;","style":"width: 648px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"禹州漏芦3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/禹州漏芦3-20240619131937-zgyh7zv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 648px;\" parent-style=\"width: 658px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807115334-syhgd1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807115334-syhgd1o","updated":"20240807115641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240717192220-dzw3lhq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717192220-dzw3lhq","updated":"20240807114509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 632px;","style":"width: 622px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"漏芦 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/漏芦 1-20240717192452-4uii967.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 622px;\" parent-style=\"width: 632px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"禹州漏芦4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/禹州漏芦4-20240619133105-lqfqrkf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619131815-8obp56a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619131815-8obp56a","updated":"20240807114516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 394px;","style":"width: 384px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"禹州漏芦2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/禹州漏芦2-20240619131815-ijd0jgo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 384px;\" parent-style=\"width: 394px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 873px;","style":"width: 863px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"漏芦"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/漏芦-20240717192337-tk3h1ma.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 863px;\" parent-style=\"width: 873px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240807114832-h2ob4ro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240807114832-h2ob4ro","updated":"20240807115642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 772px;","style":"width: 762px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"禹州漏芦 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/禹州漏芦 1-20240807114738-5fmr1r0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 762px;\" parent-style=\"width: 772px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 470px;","style":"width: 460px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"禹州漏芦 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/禹州漏芦 2-20240807115426-fgwm13p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 460px;\" parent-style=\"width: 470px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619133955-8n1p3hy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619133955-8n1p3hy","updated":"20240717192218"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240619133403-vsdyzxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619133403-vsdyzxe","updated":"20240619133419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"祁州漏芦、禹州漏芦对比"}]},{"ID":"20240619133742-wcguowa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619133742-wcguowa","updated":"20240619133923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 288px;","style":"width: 278px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240619133742-3le3uro.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 278px;\" parent-style=\"width: 288px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 302px;","style":"width: 292px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240619133843-kswpc3d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 292px;\" parent-style=\"width: 302px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 337px;","style":"width: 327px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240619133903-2k96qlz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 327px;\" parent-style=\"width: 337px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 385px;","style":"width: 375px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240619133923-0a7exhj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 375px;\" parent-style=\"width: 385px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240616135210-tlfr56h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135210-tlfr56h"}},{"ID":"20240616135249-5027ufq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135249-5027ufq","updated":"20240616135253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135249-q9pirta","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135249-q9pirta","updated":"20240616135249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135249-qqnk2xp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135249-qqnk2xp","updated":"20240616135249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主皮肤热，恶创，疽痔，湿痹，下乳汁。久服轻身益气，耳目聪明，不老延年。一名野兰。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135249-emr2u40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135249-emr2u40","updated":"20240616135249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生乔山，八月采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135249-xlgwxpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135249-xlgwxpg","updated":"20240616135249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：飞廉，漏芦也；陶宠景云：俗中取根，名鹿骊。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135623-7dqetwx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135623-7dqetwx"}},{"ID":"20240616135624-g6i9dbm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135624-g6i9dbm","updated":"20240616135632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135624-23usdrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135624-23usdrc","updated":"20240616135643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，大寒，无毒．主止遗溺，热气疮痒如麻豆，可作浴汤．生乔山．八月采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135624-gapftw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135624-gapftw7","updated":"20240616135649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶漏芦，味苦，寒．主皮肤热，恶创疽痔，湿痹，下乳汁．久服，轻身益气，耳目聪明，不老延年。一名野兰。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135339-xbcalag","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135339-xbcalag"}},{"ID":"20240616135340-h8f9ck5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135340-h8f9ck5","updated":"20240616135348"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135340-1qqxhzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135340-1qqxhzv","updated":"20240616135343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"漏芦"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生乔山山谷，今京东州郡及秦海州皆有之。旧说茎叶似白蒿，有荚，花黄生荚端，茎若箸大；其子作房，类油麻房而小，七、八月后皆黑，异于众草。今诸郡所图上，惟单州者差相类。沂州者花叶颇似牡丹。秦州者花似单叶寒菊，紫色，五、七枝同一秆上；海州者花紫碧，如单叶莲花，花萼下及根旁有白茸裹之。根黑色，如蔓菁而细，又类葱本，淮甸人呼为老翁花。三州所生花虽别，而叶颇相类，但秦、海州者，叶更作锯齿状耳。一物而殊类若此，医家何所适从，当依旧说，以单州出者为胜。六月、七月采茎苗，日干。八月采根，阴干。南方用苗，北土多用根。又此下有飞廉条云∶生河内川泽，一名漏芦。与苦芙（乌老切）"}]},{"ID":"20240616135340-du6060d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135340-du6060d","updated":"20240616135340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相类，惟叶下附茎，有皮起似箭羽，又多刻缺，花紫色，生平泽。又有一种生山岗上，叶颇相似，而无疏缺，且多毛，茎亦无羽，根直下，更旁枝生，则肉白皮黑，中有黑脉，日干则黑如玄参。《经》云∶七月、八月采花，阴干用。苏恭云∶用茎叶及疗疳蚀杀虫有验；据此所说，与秦州、海州所谓漏芦者，花叶及根颇相近，然彼人但谓之漏芦。今医家罕有用飞廉者，既未的识，故不复分别，但附其说于下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135353-p2xovkp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135353-p2xovkp"}},{"ID":"20240616135355-y4c451v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135355-y4c451v","updated":"20240616135359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135355-jv3edbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135355-jv3edbi","updated":"20240616135355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、咸，寒、大寒，无毒。主治皮肤热，恶疮，疽痔，湿痹，下乳汁。止遗溺，热气疮痒如麻豆，可作浴汤。久服轻身，益气，耳目聪明，不老延年。一名野兰。生乔山山谷。八月采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135355-bp2h0a9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135355-bp2h0a9","updated":"20240616135355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乔山应是黄帝所葬处，乃在上郡。今出近道亦有，治诸 疥，此久服甚益人，而服食方罕用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135355-bt83wlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135355-bt83wlz","updated":"20240616135355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今市人皆取苗用之。世中取根，名鹿骊根，苦酒摩，以治疮疥。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135454-70mm8k5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135454-70mm8k5"}},{"ID":"20240616135456-qfd9aep","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135456-qfd9aep","updated":"20240616135459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135456-p67uz8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135456-p67uz8y","updated":"20240616135456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸苦寒．入手足太阴经．功专散热解毒．通经下乳．排脓止血．生肌杀虫．治遗精尿血痈疽发背及痘疹毒．甘草拌蒸．连翘为使．"}]},{"ID":"20240616135503-quu0iza","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135503-quu0iza"}},{"ID":"20240616135504-est5b0y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135504-est5b0y","updated":"20240616135508"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135504-51o324w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135504-51o324w","updated":"20240616135504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"连翘为之使。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135504-yxaozef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135504-yxaozef","updated":"20240616135504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸，寒。入手足阳明经。散热毒，治谷贼，通经下乳，排脓止痛，解痘杀虫。配生姜、地龙，治历节风痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135504-bvcg7us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135504-bvcg7us","updated":"20240616135504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"茎如油麻，枯黑如漆者真。甘草拌蒸。气虚者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135557-8ydxj89","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135557-8ydxj89"}},{"ID":"20240616135558-x4wtejt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135558-x4wtejt","updated":"20240616135602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135558-camgziq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135558-camgziq","updated":"20240616135558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦大寒咸且苦，皮肤风热筋骨偻，肠风尿血及遗精，通经脉又能行乳。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135558-42smnq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135558-42smnq2","updated":"20240616135558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏，流动而长也；芦，虚也。无毒。主皮肤风热，恶疮瘙痒。凡痔漏瘰 乳痈发背，服之排脓止痛。瘾疹如麻痘者，可作浴汤。又治湿痹不仁，及跌扑续筋骨，敷金疮断血长肉。止肠风尿血泄精，通经脉，下乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135558-fp6jwtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135558-fp6jwtp","updated":"20240616135558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兼治赤眼，及小儿无辜疳泻痢，冷热不调，杀虫。出黄帝葬所乔山及单州者佳。味苦酸者伪。去芦细锉，甘草拌炒，去甘草。南人用苗，北人用根。一云即飞廉。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135548-w5b24qv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135548-w5b24qv"}},{"ID":"20240616135549-qkfa4wg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135549-qkfa4wg","updated":"20240616135553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135549-6hpcm3i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135549-6hpcm3i","updated":"20240616135549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、咸，寒、大寒，无毒。主皮肤热，恶疮，疽痔，湿痹，下乳汁。止遗溺，热气疮痒如麻豆，可作浴汤。久服轻身益气，耳目聪明，不老延年。一名野兰。生乔山山谷。八月采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135549-okfdso6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135549-okfdso6","updated":"20240616135549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乔山应是黄帝所葬处，乃在上郡。今出近道亦有，疗诸 疥，此久服甚益人，而服食方罕用。今市人皆取苗用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135549-671r4tg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135549-671r4tg","updated":"20240616135549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"俗中取根，名鹿骊根，苦酒摩，以疗疮疥。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135549-f7ehrjc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135549-f7ehrjc","updated":"20240616135549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此药俗名荚蒿，茎叶似白蒿，花黄，生荚，长似细麻，如箸许，有四、五瓣，七月、八月后皆黑，异于众草蒿之类也。常用其茎叶及子，未见用根。其鹿骊，山南谓之木藜芦，有毒，非漏芦也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135538-f4rolad","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135538-f4rolad"}},{"ID":"20240616135539-yhgkdth","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135539-yhgkdth","updated":"20240616135543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135539-7bxijdh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135539-7bxijdh","updated":"20240616135539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泻热，解毒"}]},{"ID":"20240616135539-bqsp48p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135539-bqsp48p","updated":"20240616135539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸软坚，苦下泄，寒胜热。入胃、大肠，通肺、小肠。散热解毒，通经下乳，排脓止血，生肌杀虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135539-8z1yqr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135539-8z1yqr5","updated":"20240616135539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治遗精尿血，痈疽发背（古方以漏芦汤为称首），及预解时行痘疹毒（取其寒胜热，又能入阳明故也）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135539-grme33l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135539-grme33l","updated":"20240616135539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出闽中，茎如油麻，枯黑如漆者真。甘草拌蒸。连翘为使。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135513-3vh9vml","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135513-3vh9vml"}},{"ID":"20240616135514-234s738","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135514-234s738","updated":"20240616135520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135514-v2cl09v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135514-v2cl09v","updated":"20240616135514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入阳明下乳消痈．咸苦性寒无毒品．清湿热杀虫凉血．祛除积久小儿疳．（漏芦咸苦性寒．入阳明血分．本经虽云服之益人．然毕竟疏利之品．故能下乳消痈．清湿热．治疳积．皆属阳明之病．观其命名取义．则漏芦之功．概可想见矣．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616135526-suwp775","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135526-suwp775"}},{"ID":"20240616135527-x5iddcz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135527-x5iddcz","updated":"20240616135531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135527-xaol7bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135527-xaol7bm","updated":"20240616135527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得地味之苦咸，禀天气之大寒，故无毒。苦能下泄，咸能软坚，寒能除热。入足阳明、少阳太阳、手太阴、阳明，寒而通利之药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135527-c8ruptt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135527-c8ruptt","updated":"20240616135527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦，治身体风热恶疮，皮肌搔痒隐疹，乳痈发背，痔 肠风，补血排脓，生肌长肉，引经脉，下乳汁，续筋骨，疗折伤，止遗尿泄精，除风眼湿痹。非独煎饮，堪作浴汤。但妇人妊娠，及疮疡阴症，平塌不起者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135417-zn8fn03","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135417-zn8fn03"}},{"ID":"20240616135418-isuc9bu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135418-isuc9bu","updated":"20240616135425"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《本草易读》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135418-f17d2uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135418-f17d2uu","updated":"20240616135418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草拌蒸干用。连翘为使。苗根皆可。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135418-g0fairv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135418-g0fairv","updated":"20240616135418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸，寒，无毒。入足阳明经。散热解毒，通经下乳，排脓止血，续筋长肉。疽痔疮瘰皆疗，生乔山山谷，曹，兖、汴东及秦、海诸州皆有之。苗类油麻，高六七尺，秋深黑枯如漆。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135418-ot0z237","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135418-ot0z237","updated":"20240616135418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采时用苗，八月采根。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135418-h3bd2zo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135418-h3bd2zo","updated":"20240616135418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冷劳泻痢，一两，艾叶四两，醋熬膏丸之。（验方第一。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616135418-njdqzsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135418-njdqzsk","updated":"20240616135418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产后带下。同上。（第二。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616135418-40mfnk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135418-40mfnk1","updated":"20240616135418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白秃头疮，烧灰，猪油合敷。（第三。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616135443-grkmn5x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135443-grkmn5x"}},{"ID":"20240616135444-ddow7a9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135444-ddow7a9","updated":"20240616135448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《雷公炮炙论》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135444-cr8j7nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135444-cr8j7nt","updated":"20240616135444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，勿用独漏，缘似漏芦，只是味苦、酸。误服，令人吐不止，须细验。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135444-z41l5wi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135444-z41l5wi","updated":"20240616135444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夫使漏芦，细锉，拌生甘草相对蒸，从巳至申，去甘草，净拣用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135431-0b8kte7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135431-0b8kte7"}},{"ID":"20240616135432-22j0pgt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135432-22j0pgt","updated":"20240616135439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135432-8lp38nh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135432-8lp38nh","updated":"20240616135432"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味苦咸，软坚消瘿，泻热解毒，为外科专药。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135404-vx6mrfp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135404-vx6mrfp"}},{"ID":"20240616135405-9l64cx4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135405-9l64cx4","updated":"20240616135413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135405-cprwcf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135405-cprwcf6","updated":"20240616135405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、咸，寒、大寒，无毒。主皮肤热，恶疮，疽痔，湿痹，下乳汁，止遗溺，热气疮痒如麻豆，可作浴汤。久服轻身益气，耳目聪明，不老延年。一名野兰。生乔山山谷。八月采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135405-4ke8ttf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135405-4ke8ttf","updated":"20240616135405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶乔山应是黄帝所葬处，乃在上郡。今出近道亦有，疗诸 疥，此久服甚益人，而服食方罕用之。今市人皆取苗用之。俗中取根，名鹿骊（力支切）根，苦酒摩，以疗疮疥。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135405-k8x07fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135405-k8x07fd","updated":"20240616135405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本注云∶此药俗名荚蒿，茎叶似白蒿，花黄，生荚，长似细麻，如箸许，有四、五瓣，七月、八月后皆黑，异于众草蒿之类也。常用其茎、叶及子，未见用根。其鹿骊，山南谓之木藜芦，有毒，非漏芦也。今按别本注云∶漏芦，茎箸大，高四、五尺，子房似油麻房而小。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135405-at2i5mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135405-at2i5mc","updated":"20240616135405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"江东人取其苗用，胜于根。江宁及上党者佳。陶注云∶根名鹿骊，唐注云∶山南人名木藜芦，皆非也。漏芦自别尔。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶叶似角蒿，今曹、兖州下湿地最多。六月、七月采茎，日干之，黑于众草。药性论云∶漏芦，君。能治身上热毒风，生恶疮，皮肌瘙痒，瘾疹。陈藏器云∶按漏芦，南人用苗，北土多用根。树生如茱萸。树高二、三尺，有毒，杀虫。山人洗疮疥用之。日华子云∶连翘为使。治小儿壮热，通小肠，泄精，尿血，风赤眼，乳痈，发背，瘰 ，肠风，排脓，补血。治扑损，续筋骨，敷金疮，止血长肉，通经脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135405-7r768f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135405-7r768f7","updated":"20240616135405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花、苗并同用，俗呼为鬼油麻，形并气味似干牛蒡，头上有白花子。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135405-h7pztcs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135405-h7pztcs","updated":"20240616135405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶漏芦，生乔山山谷，今京东州郡及秦、海州皆有之。旧说茎叶似白蒿，有荚，花黄，生荚端，茎若箸大，其子作房，类油麻房而小，七、八月后皆黑，异于众草。今诸郡所图上，唯单州者差相类，沂州者花叶颇似牡丹。秦州者花似单叶寒菊，紫色，五、七枝同一秆干上。海州者花紫碧，如单叶莲花，花萼下及根旁有白茸裹之，根黑色如蔓菁而细，又类葱本，淮甸人呼为老翁花。三州所生，花虽别而叶颇相类，但秦、海州者，叶更作锯齿状耳。一物而殊类若此，医家何所适从，当依旧说，以单州出者为胜，六月、七月采茎苗，日干，八月采根，阴干。南方用苗，北土多用根。又此下有飞廉条云∶生河内川泽，一名漏芦，与苦（乌老切）相类，唯叶下附茎有皮起似箭羽，又多刻缺，花紫色，生平泽。又有一种生山岗上，叶颇相似而无疏缺，且多毛，茎亦无羽，根直下更旁枝生，则肉白皮黑，中有黑脉，日干则黑如玄参。《经》云∶七月、八月采花阴干用。苏恭云∶用茎叶及疗疳蚀杀虫有验。据此所说，与秦州、海州所谓漏芦者，花叶及根颇相近，然彼人但谓之漏芦，今医家罕有用飞廉者。既未的识，故不复分别，但附其说于下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135405-qartxbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135405-qartxbd","updated":"20240616135405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，勿用独漏，缘似漏芦，只是味苦、酸，误服令人吐不止，须细验。夫使漏芦，细锉，拌生甘草相对蒸，从巳至申，去甘草净拣用。圣惠方∶治小儿无辜疳，肚胀或时泻痢，冷热不调。以漏芦一两，杵为散。每服以猪肝一两，散子一钱匕，盐少许，以水煮熟，空心顿服。外台秘要∶治蛔虫，漏芦，杵，以饼 和方寸匕，服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135210-4tvqkoh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135210-4tvqkoh"}},{"ID":"20240616135241-fuiaszt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135241-fuiaszt","updated":"20240616135245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135241-6mrcsj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135241-6mrcsj9","updated":"20240616135241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，微寒，入足少阴肾、足厥阴肝经。利水秘精，凉血败毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135241-7er8buv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135241-7er8buv","updated":"20240616135241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦咸寒，利水泻湿，清肝退热，治失溺遗精。淋血便红，眼痛目赤，背疽乳痈，痔瘘瘰疬，白秃金疮，历节带下，泄利。治一切虫伤跌打，恶疮毒肿。排脓止血，服浴皆善。下乳汁最捷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135210-4bdsee4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135210-4bdsee4"}},{"ID":"20240616135229-rfb22p6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135229-rfb22p6","updated":"20240616135234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135229-nzywgqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135229-nzywgqi","updated":"20240616135229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（隰草）解胃府热毒并通乳汁"}]},{"ID":"20240616135229-nz6gfug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135229-nz6gfug","updated":"20240616135229"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦（专入胃）。味苦而咸。气寒有毒。凡苦则下泄。咸则软坚。寒则胜热。漏芦气味俱备。其性专入阳明胃经。故凡痈疽背发。乳汁不通。及预解时行痘毒者。咸须仗此以邪。俾邪尽从便出而解矣！（诸症非尽热毒而起。不得妄用。）然书又云。遗精尿血能止。亦因毒解热除自止之意。非因漏芦寓有收涩之力也。但气虚疮疡不起。及孕妇有病者切忌。出闽中。茎如油麻。枯黑如漆者真。甘草拌连翘为使。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135211-co6tyde","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135211-co6tyde"}},{"ID":"20240616135211-qljc999","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135211-qljc999","updated":"20240616135219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《滇南本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135211-jdri4rg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135211-jdri4rg","updated":"20240616135214"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"漏芦"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一名芦葱，又名萱草，又名宜男花。味甘、平，性寒。治乳结红肿硬痛，乳汁不通，乳痈乳岩，攻痈疮。滇中产者，其性补阴血，止腰疼，治崩漏，止大肠下血。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135211-uxt5c7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135211-uxt5c7q","updated":"20240616135211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（附方） 治男妇腰痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135211-7hd7kr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135211-7hd7kr0","updated":"20240616135211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦根果（十五个） 猪腰子（一个） 以上二味水煎服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135211-5ra5igx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135211-5ra5igx","updated":"20240616135211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（又单方） 治大肠下血，诸药不效者用此良。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135211-dgt25ry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135211-dgt25ry","updated":"20240616135211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦根果（十个） 茶花（五分） 赤地榆（三钱） 象牙末（一钱） 以上四味水煎服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135031-fz0fuib","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135031-fz0fuib"}},{"ID":"20240616135157-msukfog","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135157-msukfog","updated":"20240616135202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135157-gzznvvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135157-gzznvvn","updated":"20240616135157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦咸。性寒。无毒。得地苦咸之味。禀天大寒之气以生。降也。阴也。连翘为使。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135157-a0pwr69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135157-a0pwr69","updated":"20240616135157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主皮肤热毒。恶疮疽痔。湿痹。下乳汁。（本经）止遗溺。热气疮痒。通经脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135157-ccqr30z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135157-ccqr30z","updated":"20240616135157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（别血生【归经】入脾胃胆大肠膀胱五经。为泄热解毒之品。（胃本经药寒而通利）【前论】庞安常曰。预解时行痘疹毒。取其寒胜热。又入阳明故也。无则以山栀代之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135157-8bqorzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135157-8bqorzj","updated":"20240616135157"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时珍【禁忌】经疏曰。妊娠禁用。疮疡阴症平塌不起发者。真气虚也。法当内塞。漏芦苦寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135032-tjf3dxn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135032-tjf3dxn"}},{"ID":"20240616135146-u9fxfbx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135146-u9fxfbx","updated":"20240616135150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135146-tfxmhj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135146-tfxmhj4","updated":"20240616135146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"《本经》名野兰"}]},{"ID":"20240616135146-upfjkwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135146-upfjkwf","updated":"20240616135146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦咸寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135146-uc9ejj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135146-uc9ejj4","updated":"20240616135146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主皮肤热毒，恶疮疽，痔漏痹，下乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135146-u6a9bxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135146-u6a9bxl","updated":"20240616135146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦苦寒解毒，乃足阳明经药。《本经》治热毒恶疮，下乳汁，以其能利窍也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135146-ic8hpf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135146-ic8hpf4","updated":"20240616135146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为消毒、排脓、杀虫要药。古方治痈疽发背，以漏芦汤为首称。盖咸能软坚，寒能解毒。故服之必大便作泻，使邪从下而出也。昔人治婴儿疮毒，令母服此，使药性从乳中过之，每致乳子利下白沫，大损元气，故气虚及疮疡不起发者，咸非所宜，而妊妇尤为切禁。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135032-q7ipcmz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135032-q7ipcmz"}},{"ID":"20240616135136-74tlaay","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135136-74tlaay","updated":"20240616135140"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135136-erd53mm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135136-erd53mm","updated":"20240616135136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治泻热。解毒。通经下乳。排脓利脉络续筋骨杀三虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135136-cxuxj4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135136-cxuxj4q","updated":"20240616135136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瘰痈疽。发背痔疮。漏芦丸。漏芦秦艽葳蕤枳壳（麸炒）槟榔大黄各一两。防风独活黄时温酒下。治香港脚生疮。脓血疼痛。又方。漏芦二两。猪肝（爆干）楮根白皮（锉）各一两。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135136-u934w2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135136-u934w2u","updated":"20240616135136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"研末蜜丸弹子大。每服一丸。熟汤化下。治疳痢羸弱不欲饮食。及腹内虫动作。多吐清水。量大小加减。漏芦散。漏芦升麻大黄黄芩各一两。蓝叶玄参各二两。研粗末每服二钱。水治脏腑积热发毒。时疫。疙瘩。头面红肿。咽喉堵塞。水药不下。一切危恶疫疠。肿芒硝二钱五分。又方。漏芦二两五钱。蛇蜕（炙）十条。栝蒌（急火烧焦存性）十枚。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135136-jumzdsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135136-jumzdsn","updated":"20240616135136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每服二钱。温酒下。服后即以猪蹄汁投之。治乳妇气脉壅塞。乳汁不行。及经络凝滞。奶乳胀痛。留蓄邪毒。或作痈肿。漏芦汤漏芦升麻连翘麻黄各一两。防己木香白蔹沉香各五钱。大黄（锉炒）一两五钱。锉碎。每服五钱。水一盏半。加竹叶七片。煎至七分。加芒硝一钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135136-gz0bgfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135136-gz0bgfs","updated":"20240616135136"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"搅匀去滓空腹下。取利二三行。不利再服。治附骨疽。按此药流走。凡体虚及疮非孕者均忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135301-h0ei69o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135301-h0ei69o"}},{"ID":"20240616135302-nelsxco","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-nelsxco","updated":"20240616135306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏卢《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-i4w2kju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-i4w2kju","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名野兰、荚蒿、鬼油麻。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-plvcxn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-plvcxn9","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（根、苗）咸、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-lc7pl7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-lc7pl7i","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-9ny7pws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-9ny7pws","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、腹内蛔虫。用漏卢为末，每取一匙，和饼子肉汤同服。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-xyxbf01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-xyxbf01","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小儿疳病肚胀，或常泻痢，冷热不调。用漏卢一两，研细。每服一钱，加猪肝一两或盐少许同煮熟，空心一次服完。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-2254ban","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-2254ban","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、冷劳泄痢。用漏卢一两、艾叶（炒）四两，共研为末。取末一半，加醋三升同熬成膏，别把另一半药末加入，和成丸子，如梧子大。每服三十丸，温水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-mlfkuvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-mlfkuvr","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、产后带下。治方同上。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-563gcrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-563gcrn","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、乳汁不下（乳内胀痛，积久成痈）。用漏卢二两半、蛇蜕十条（灸焦）、瓜萎十个（烧存性），共研为末。每服二钱，温酒调下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-ezh31b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-ezh31b1","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、风痛，筋脉拘挛。用汛（麸炒）半两、地龙（去土，炒）半两，共研为末；另用生姜二两，取汁，加入三两蜜，同煎开几次，又加好酒五合，收存待用。服药时，取上制的药末，以收存的汤剂煨温后送下。此方名“古圣散”。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-lcnb6z8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-lcnb6z8","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、背痈。用漏卢、连翘、生黄芪、沉香各一两，生粉草半两，大黄（微炒）一两，共研为末。每服二钱，姜枣汤调下。服至热退便停药。此方名“漏卢汤”。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135302-eyz7jkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135302-eyz7jkw","updated":"20240616135302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、白秃头疮。用漏卢草烧灰，加猪油调匀涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135610-1wlglh6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616135610-1wlglh6"}},{"ID":"20240616135611-ghfh1ib","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-ghfh1ib","updated":"20240616135615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-gw4tm39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-gw4tm39","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】本品为菊科植物漏芦的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-edouiib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-edouiib","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】苦，寒。入胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-x5o5cel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-x5o5cel","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】清热解毒，消痈肿，下乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-ggr1px6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-ggr1px6","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用治疮痈初起，以及乳汁不下、乳房肿痛等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-iy9cr7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-iy9cr7a","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品苦寒，有清热解毒消痈的功效，对于疮痈初起红肿热痛，常与连翘、大黄等配合应用；对于乳房红肿疼痛欲成痈肿者，常与瓜蒌、蒲公英、贝母等配合应用。本品且能通乳汁，与通草、王不留行等配伍，又可用于乳汁不下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-ieyo6ae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-ieyo6ae","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于各种肿瘤。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-c3aoe18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-c3aoe18","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漏芦在临床上又可用于各种肿瘤。如用于肝肿瘤，常与半枝莲、半边莲、石见穿等配合应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-p94919t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-p94919t","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】漏芦（洗净，晒干，切片用）"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-b4z7xy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-b4z7xy3","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】一钱至四钱，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240616135611-nhas363","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616135611-nhas363","updated":"20240616135611"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】漏芦汤《卫生宝鉴》：漏芦、升麻、大黄、黄芩、蓝叶、玄参。治脏腑积热发毒，头面红肿，咽喉阻塞，水药不下，一切危急疫疠。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123933-1zji7oy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607123933-1zji7oy"}},{"ID":"20240607124312-y7sij7g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-y7sij7g","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：漏芦"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-rt8zahe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-rt8zahe","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-dhohxdv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-dhohxdv","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lòu Lú"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-k6ml1wq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-k6ml1wq","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-cwc92hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-cwc92hb","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 狼头花"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-z5nz1fi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-z5nz1fi","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-aqjitgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-aqjitgu","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" RADIX RHAPONTICI"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-q23uf4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-q23uf4v","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-a7euqj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-a7euqj2","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为菊科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"祁州漏芦"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Rhaponticum uniflorum （L.）DC.的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春、秋二季采挖，除去须根及泥沙，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-fslkdxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-fslkdxv","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ubd2b94","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ubd2b94","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈圆锥形或扁片块状，多扭曲，长短不一，直径1～2.5cm。表面暗棕色、灰褐色或黑褐色，粗糙，具纵沟及菱形的网状裂隙。外层易剥落，根头部膨大，有残茎及鳞片状叶基，顶端有灰白色绒毛。体轻，质脆，易折断，断面不整齐，灰黄色，有裂隙，中心有的呈星状裂隙，灰黑色或棕黑色。气特异，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-81lg6ag","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-81lg6ag","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-meqnfkq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-meqnfkq","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-d1lnnrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-d1lnnrl","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-4bgaart","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-4bgaart","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除去杂质，洗净，润透，切厚片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-gceqx9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-gceqx9m","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-nu7wq0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-nu7wq0z","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品粉末1g，加甲醇20ml，超声处理20分钟，滤过，滤液蒸干，残渣加醋酸乙酯1ml 使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取漏芦对照药材1g，同法制成对照药材溶液，照薄层色谱法（附录Ⅵ B）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各5μl，分别点于同一硅胶Ｇ薄层板上，以环己烷－丁酮（4:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，置紫外光灯（365nm）下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同的荧光斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-vonljvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-vonljvi","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-q8p304u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-q8p304u","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-6gmoytd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-6gmoytd","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-8k6qjam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-8k6qjam","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-097bszt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-097bszt","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-elei8j8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-elei8j8","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-qn5faou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-qn5faou","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-z0p2165","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-z0p2165","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热解毒，消痈，下乳，舒筋通脉。用于乳痈肿痛，痈疽发背，瘰疬疮毒，乳汁不通，湿痹拘挛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-7sygfby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-7sygfby","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-41xhrbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-41xhrbv","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 5～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-w218t19","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-w218t19","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-gd4l5eg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-gd4l5eg","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）对于疮痈初起红肿热痛，常与连翘、大黄等配合应用；对于乳房红肿疼痛欲成痈肿者，常与瓜蒌、蒲公英、贝母等配合应用。本品且能通乳汁，与通草、王不留行等配伍，又可用于乳汁不下。又可用于各种肿瘤。如用于肝肿瘤，常与半枝莲、半边莲、石见穿等配合应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-29ay92k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-29ay92k","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-yriqceu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-yriqceu","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-f22vjj7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-f22vjj7","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：漏芦"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-qhayuf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-qhayuf0","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-c101v1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-c101v1d","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lòu Lú"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-xnfiaiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-xnfiaiy","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-10xky4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-10xky4q","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 野兰（《本经》），鬼油麻（《日华子本草》），独花山牛蒡、和尚头花。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ylgj2z6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ylgj2z6","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-jzicp0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-jzicp0q","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-4cnuarw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-4cnuarw","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-darsphf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-darsphf","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为菊科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"祁州漏芦"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"禹州漏芦"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季采挖，除去残茎及须根，洗净泥土，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-emzg1fw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-emzg1fw","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-lrmzfp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-lrmzfp4","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①祁州漏芦，又名：和尚头、独花山牛蒡。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-46dktk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-46dktk0","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生草本，高25～65厘米。主根粗大。茎直立，单一，密生蛛丝状毛及白色柔毛。基生叶有长柄；叶片长椭圆形，长12～25厘米，宽5～10厘米，羽状全裂呈琴形，裂片常再羽状深裂或浅裂，两面均被蛛丝状毛或粗糙毛茸；中部叶及上部叶较小，有短柄或无柄。头状花序顶生，大形，直径5～6.5厘米；总苞广钟形，总苞片干膜质，多列，外列与中列匙形，先端有扩大成圆形撕裂状的附属体，最内一列狭披针形或线形，较外列为长；花全部管状花，淡红紫色；花冠长2～3厘米，先端5裂；雄蕊5，花药聚合；子房下位，花柱伸出，柱头2裂，紫色。瘦果倒圆锥形，长约5～6毫米，黑褐色，有宿存之羽状冠毛。花期5～7月。果期6～8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-k7gqfxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-k7gqfxq","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于向阳的山坡、草地、路边。分布黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、内蒙古、河北、山东、山西、陕西、甘肃等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-dh608ho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-dh608ho","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②蓝刺头，又名：华州漏芦、禹州漏芦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-mmo7mv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-mmo7mv6","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生草本，高35～65厘米，全株被白色蛛丝状毡毛。茎直立。叶互生，近根部叶较大，有柄；茎上部叶无柄；叶片椭圆形，长4～10厘米，宽2～6厘米，羽状分裂，裂片三角形或卵状披针形，先端锐尖，边缘有尖刺，上面暗黄绿色，被蛛丝状毛，下面密被白色蛛丝状毡毛，呈白色。多数小头状花序集合成圆球形，直径2.3～3.5厘米；小头状花序有白色刚毛状的外总苞，基部联合，向上有鳞片状总苞2轮，内轮较外轮长，披针形，长约1厘米，宽约2毫米，中脉顶端伸出成刺，上郎天蓝色，下部淡绿白色；总苞内有一管状花，长约1.5厘米，先端5裂，天蓝色，冠毛不发达；雄蕊5，花药聚合；子房倒钟形，被茸毛，柱头2裂。瘦果杯状，被白色长毛。花期7～9月。果期10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-jhvaykl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-jhvaykl","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于山坡草丛中及山野向阳处。分布黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、河北、河南、山西、内蒙古、江苏、湖北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-z3gvow3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-z3gvow3","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-9ow46as","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-9ow46as","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①祁州漏芦"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-f7peh6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-f7peh6x","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥根呈圆锥形或破裂成较大的块状，多扭曲，长10～30厘米，中部直径1～2厘米。外皮灰褐色或棕黑色，多纵沟及交叉的网状裂纹，时有浮皮，顶端常见灰白色丝状毛茸。质轻而脆，易折断，断面不整齐，有灰黄色菊花纹及裂隙，中心灰黑色或棕黑色。臭特异，味微苦。以外皮灰黑色、条粗、质坚、不裂者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-mvqs1wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-mvqs1wk","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产河北、辽宁、山西。此外陕西、山东、吉林、黑龙江、内蒙古等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-89rhifk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-89rhifk","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②禹州漏芦"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-bw6qhnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-bw6qhnv","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为蓝刺头的干燥根，呈类圆柱形，上粗下细，稍扭曲，长10～30厘米，直径1～2厘米。外皮灰褐色或灰黄色，粗糙，有纵皱纹，顶端丛生棕色硬毛，为残存的叶柄维管束，下端偶有分枝。质坚，不易折断，断面外圈褐色，内有黄、黑相间的菊花纹。无臭，味微涩。以条粗、坚实者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-66a5xek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-66a5xek","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产安徽、湖北、河南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-16bfv80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-16bfv80","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ujxypfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ujxypfw","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祁州漏芦根含挥发油。新疆蓝刺头果实含蓝刺头扔碱，种子含蓝刺头碱及蓝刺头宁碱。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ovur491","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ovur491","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-72o9bvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-72o9bvn","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 新疆蓝刺头：①对中枢神经系统的作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-w5bo56p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-w5bo56p","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝刺头碱的作用与士的宁相似，小剂量对动物表现兴奋作用，大剂量则引起痉挛，以后出现全身抑制，对巴比妥引起的小鼠睡眠有苏醒作用，并能兴奋神经肌肉装置，促进周围神经的恢复过程。临床上可治疗各种不全麻痹症及由于末梢或中枢性运动神经原传导障碍之瘫痪，对全身性衰弱基础上的血管性营养不良的病人有强壮作用。对实验性创伤性麻痹亦有治疗作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-z7abclt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-z7abclt","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②对心血管系统的影响"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-5uibs0s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-5uibs0s","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝刺头碱对麻醉猫可引起血压下降，心收缩力增强，对离体蛙心可使心收缩张力上升，收缩幅度减弱，高浓度可使心脏停止于收缩期，对离体兔耳表现血管扩张。国外将其果子用于高血压及动脉粥样硬化病人，作为强心剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-oqsppg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-oqsppg1","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③其他"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-3kyotuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-3kyotuk","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝刺头碱可使猫离体肠管张力增加，对兔离体肠管则抑制。其致痉作用较士的宁弱，提高反射活动的剂量（3～6毫克/公斤）与致死量（600～650毫克/公斤）相差很大，毒性较低。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-o7s5ync","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-o7s5ync","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ke72nbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ke72nbg","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，去毛，洗净，润透，切片晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-nb33sq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-nb33sq7","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡使漏芦，细锉，拌生甘草相对蒸，从巳至申，去甘草净拣用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-r4lmluv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-r4lmluv","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-4znb5jt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-4znb5jt","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入胃、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-42sge90","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-42sge90","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①李杲：\"手、足阳明。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-3280nvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-3280nvy","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《木草从新》：\"入胃、大肠，通肺、小肠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-9n3lq7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-9n3lq7l","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《玉楸药解》：\"入足少阴肾、足厥阴肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-cij5v0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-cij5v0r","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-nbnotzc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-nbnotzc","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦咸，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-rc368af","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-rc368af","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-gsruueu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-gsruueu","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"大寒，无毒。’"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-olrpo4u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-olrpo4u","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草正》：\"味微咸，性寒，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-4e5w95u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-4e5w95u","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-njb7jid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-njb7jid","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 气虚、疮疡平塌不起及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-67qov52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-67qov52","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《日华子本草》：\"连翘为使。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-mnnk3kf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-mnnk3kf","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"疮疡阴症，平塌不起发者，非所宜投。妊娠禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-s1bl06g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-s1bl06g","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《得配本草》：\"气虚者禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-q59djy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-q59djy3","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-5jklse2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-5jklse2","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热解毒，消肿排脓，下乳，通筋脉。治痈疽发背，乳房肿痛。乳汁不通，瘰疬恶疮，湿痹筋脉拘牵，骨节疼痛，热毒血痢，痔疮出血。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-oifq9vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-oifq9vz","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主皮肤热，恶疮疽痔，湿痹，下乳汁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-rcax527","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-rcax527","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"止遗溺，热气疮痒如麻豆，可作浴汤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-tu6qw2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-tu6qw2p","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③陶弘景：\"疗诸瘘疥。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ik2pq1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ik2pq1h","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药性论t》：\"治身上热毒风生恶疮，皮肌瘙痒瘾疹。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-rx62s8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-rx62s8r","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草拾遗》：\"杀虫，洗疮疥用之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ux6lmq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ux6lmq4","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《日华子本草》：\"治小儿壮热，通小肠，（治）泄精，尿血，风赤眼，乳痈，发背，瘰疬，肠风，排脓，补血，治扑损，续筋骨，敷金疮，止血长肉，通经脉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-02ew27w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-02ew27w","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《山西中药志》：\"清热凉血，治热毒血痢，鼻衄，血痔，温疫等症。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-0ki4fx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-0ki4fx7","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-tbzdjsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-tbzdjsq","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱（鲜者1～2两）；或入丸、散。外用：煎水洗或研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-kwib6v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-kwib6v1","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-rea1wps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-rea1wps","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疽作二日后，退毒下脓：黄芪（生用）、连翘各一两，大黄一分（微炒），漏芦一两（有白茸者），甘草半两（生用），沉香一两。上为末，姜、枣汤调下。（《集验背疽方》漏芦汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-4k28rft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-4k28rft","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治乳妇气脉壅塞，乳汁不行，及经络凝滞，乳内胀痛，留蓄邪毒，或作痈肿：漏芦二两半，瓜蒌十个（急火烧焦存性），蛇蜕十条（炙）。上为细散，每服二钱，温酒调服，不拘时，良久吃热羹汤助之。（《局方》漏芦散）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-tgbhcf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-tgbhcf0","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治瘰疬，排脓、止痛、生肌：漏芦、连翘、紫花地丁、贝母、金银花，甘草、夏枯草各等分。水煎服。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-jtsxwg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-jtsxwg4","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治皮肤瘙痒，阴疹，风毒，疮疥：漏芦、荆芥、白鲜皮、浮萍、牛膝、当归、蕲蛇，枸杞子各一两，甘草六钱，苦参二两。浸酒蒸饮。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-gxt3f4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-gxt3f4x","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治流行性腮腺炎：板蓝根一钱，漏芦一钱半，牛蒡子四分，甘草五分。水煎服。（《新疆中草药手册》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ae6bzed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ae6bzed","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治历节风，筋脉拘挛，骨节疼痛：漏芦半两（去芦头，麸炒），地龙（去土，炒）半两。上二味捣罗为末。先用生姜二两取汁，蜜二两，同煎三、五沸，入好酒五合，以瓷器盛。每用七分盏调药末一钱半匕，温服不拘时。（《圣济总录》古圣散）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-1o4184z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-1o4184z","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治小儿无辜疳痢，羸弱，不欲饮食，及腹内虫动作，多吐清水：漏芦二两，猪肝一两（煿干），楮树根白皮一两（锉）。上药，捣罗为末，炼蜜和捣一、二百杵，丸如弹子大。每服以温水研一九，不计时候，量儿大小，分减服之。（《圣惠方》漏芦丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-z4l70ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-z4l70ai","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治冷劳泄痢，及妇人产后带下诸疾：漏芦（去芦头）一两，艾叶（去梗炒）四两。上二味，捣罗为末，用米醋三升，入药末一半，先熬成膏，后入余药和丸如梧桐子大。每服三十丸，温米饮下，食前服。（《圣济总录》漏芦丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-akfmd1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-akfmd1n","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治室女月术不调：漏芦（去芦头）、当归（切，焙）、红花子、枳壳（去瓤，麸炒）、白茯苓（去黑皮）、人参各半两。上六味，粗捣筛，每服三钱匕，水一盏，煎七分，去滓，温服，不拘时。（《圣济总录》漏芦汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-s4flr1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-s4flr1d","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治白秃：五月收漏芦草，烧作灰，膏和使涂之，先用盐汤洗。乃敷。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-yho8dcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-yho8dcu","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-hmtp07l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-hmtp07l","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《纲目》：\"漏芦，下乳汁、消热毒、排脓、止血、生肌、杀虫，故东垣以为手，足阳明药，而古方治痈疽发背，以漏芦汤为首称也。庞安常《伤寒论》治痈疽及预解时行痘疹热，用漏芦叶，云无则以山栀子代之，亦取其寒能解热，盖不知其能入阳明之故也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-7xcx572","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-7xcx572","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"漏芦，苦能下泄，咸能软坚，寒能除热，寒而通利之药也。故主皮肤热，恶疮疽痔，湿痹，下乳汁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-htcu9hj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-htcu9hj","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本经逢原》：\"漏芦，《本经》治热毒恶疮，下乳汁，以其能利窍也，为消毒排脓杀虫要药。盖咸能软坚，寒能解毒，故服之必大便作泻，使邪从下而出也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-hyhxqz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-hyhxqz0","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草求真》：\"漏芦，遗精尿血能止，亦因毒解热除自止之意，非因漏芦寓有收涩之功也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-g465nfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-g465nfq","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本经续疏》：\"漏芦，《本经》谓其下乳汁，《别录》谓其止遗溺，旨实相反，何欤?夫溺以温化而通，乳以清纯而下。遗溺因乎热，乳不下亦因乎热，非有二也。惟其利水由于除热，是以能使不应行者归于应行，而应行者不得应行而不行，则漏芦者谓为疡证逐湿之剂可也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-db2v53z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-db2v53z","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草正义》：\"漏芦，滑利泄热，与王不留行功用最近，而寒苦直泄，尤其过之。苟非实热，不可轻用。不独耗阴，尤损正气。《日华》谓通小肠，治泄精溺血，肠风乳痈，排脓止痛，通经脉，皆惟实热之症，可以暂用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-nn0jv5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-nn0jv5x","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-jjuloxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-jjuloxv","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除上述品种外，在江苏等地尚有以菊科植物东南蓝刺头的根作禹州漏芦使用。在新疆地区又以菊科植物新疆蓝刺头的根作漏芦使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-gjo7w47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-gjo7w47","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-3g8cwgm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-3g8cwgm","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-vzrg3ad","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-vzrg3ad","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：漏芦"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-y5g0vya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-y5g0vya","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-4oazt7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-4oazt7a","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Lòu Lú"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-e4s9fqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-e4s9fqb","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-epwahh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-epwahh2","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 野兰、鹿骊、鬼油麻、和尚头、大头翁、独花山牛蒡、祁漏芦、禹漏芦、龙葱根、毛头"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-s6w7r9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-s6w7r9n","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-xxv5m1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-xxv5m1g","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Uniflower Swisscentaury Root,Root of Broadleaf Globethistle"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-br19hl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-br19hl8","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-c94l5kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-c94l5kb","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》1.《雷公炮炙论》：凡使漏芦，勿用独漏，缘似漏芦，只是味苦酸，误服令人吐不止，须细验。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-el2nisx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-el2nisx","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：漏芦，生乔山山谷。八月采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-hw2htds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-hw2htds","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.陶弘景：漏芦，今近道亦有。市人皆取苗用之，俗中取根名鹿骊。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ckimtkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ckimtkh","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《唐本草》：漏芦，俗名荚蒿，茎叶似白蒿，花黄，生荚长似细麻，如箸许，有四、五瓣。七月、八月后皆黑，异于众草，蒿之类也。常用其茎叶及子，未见用根。其鹿骊，山南谓"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ov1pxs4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ov1pxs4","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-jkd7ohm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-jkd7ohm","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为菊科植物祁州漏芦或禹州漏芦的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-d7zrw1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-d7zrw1s","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Stemmacantha uniflorum (L.)DitTCMLIBich [Cnicus uniflorus L.; Rhaponticum uniflorum (L.)DC.]2.Echinops latifolius Tausch."}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-kviul75","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-kviul75","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋后采收，除去泥土，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-gr51fve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-gr51fve","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-w2xi0nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-w2xi0nt","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生于海拔390-2700m的山坡丘陵地、松林下或桦木林下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-5s23sf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-5s23sf0","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生于林缘、干燥山坡、草丛向阳处。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-5l6z3l3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-5l6z3l3","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于东北及内蒙古、河北、山西、陕西、甘肃、青海、山东、江南、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-gh5kmee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-gh5kmee","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.分布于东北及内蒙古、河北、山西、陕西、宁夏、甘肃等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-6o4yv12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-6o4yv12","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-w10g2xj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-w10g2xj","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.祁州漏芦 多年生草本，高（-6）30-100cm。根状茎粗厚，主根圆柱形，直径1-2cm，上部密被残存叶柄。茎直立，不分枝，簇生或单生，有条纹，具白色绵毛或短毛。基生叶有长柄，叶柄长6-20cm，被厚绵毛；基生叶及下部茎叶全为椭圆形，长12-25cm，贡5-10cm，羽状全裂呈琴形，裂片常再羽状深裂或深裂，两面均被蛛丝状毛或粗糙毛茸；中部及上部叶较小，有短柄或无柄。头状花序，单生茎顶，直径约5cm；总苞宽钟状，基部凹；总苞片多层，具干膜质附片，外层短，卵形，中层附片宽，成掌状分裂，内层披针形，先端尖锐；花冠淡紫色，长约2.5cm，下部条形，上部稍扩张成圆筒形，先端5裂；雄蕊5，花药聚合；子房下位，花柱伸出，柱头2裂，紫色。瘦果，倒圆锥形，长5-6mm，棕褐色，具四棱；冠毛刚毛状，具羽产太短毛。花期5-7月，果期6-8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-6cey9sc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-6cey9sc","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.禹州漏芦 多年生草本，高约1m。茎直立，不分枝或少分枝，上部密生白绵毛，下部疏生蛛丝状毛。叶二回羽状分裂或深裂，上面疏生蛛丝状毛或无毛，下面密生白绵毛，边缘短刺；基生叶有长柄，叶生矩圆状倒卵形，长约20cm；上部叶渐小，长椭圆形至卵形，长10-20cm，基部抱茎。复头状花序，集合成圆球形，直径约4cm；头状花序长近2cm，外总苞片刚毛状，基部联合；内总苞片外层的匙形，先端渐尖，边缘有篦状睫毛；内层的狭鞭形至矩圆形，先端尖锐，中部以上有睫毛；花冠筒状，裂片5，条形，淡蓝色，筒部白色；雄蕊5，花药聚合；子房倒钟形，被茸毛，柱头2裂。瘦果，圆形，密生黄褐色柔毛；冠毛长约1mm，下部连合花期7-9月，果期10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-jvsmjl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-jvsmjl1","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-w0s0m7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-w0s0m7v","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 （1）祁州漏芦 根呈倒圆锥状圆柱形，有的稍扭曲或扁压，通常不分枝，完整者长10-30cm，直径1-2.5cm。表面深棕色或黑棕色，粗糙，具不规则的纵形沟纹及鞭形的网状裂隙，外层常有剥裂。根头部膨大，有少数茎基及鳞片状的叶基，顶端有灰白色绒毛。质罗而脆，易折断，折断时皮部常与木部脱离，皮部色泽较深，木部黄白色，呈施射状，木射线处多破裂，木部中央因朽蚀而成星状裂隙，显深棕色。气特异，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-rg36o9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-rg36o9z","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以条粗、棕黑色、质坚实、不碎裂者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-aphkhlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-aphkhlm","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)禹州漏芦 根呈类圆柱形，稍扭曲，知短不一，直径0.5-1.5cm。表面土黄色或灰棕色，粗糙，具纵皱纹，顶端有纤维状棕色残存的叶柄维管束。质坚，断面粗纤维状，皮部棕色，木部具黄黑相间的菊纹。气微，味微涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-lljuzrg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-lljuzrg","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以枝条粗长。表面土棕以、质坚实，长短整齐者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-1k3o8ld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-1k3o8ld","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 （1）祁州漏芦根横切面：表皮常已脱落，后生皮层为数层至20余层棕色细胞，壁稍厚，木化及木栓化。韧皮部较被广大，射线宽。形成层成环。木质部导和呈多股性排列，有时小形导管群将大形导管群分隔成数段，木射线常有径向裂隙。中央有时呈星状裂隙，其周围的细胞壁常木栓化。本品薄壁组中有油室分布，油室周围的分泌细胞内含黄棕色分泌物。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-lweizax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-lweizax","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，根头非腺毛多细胞，木化，完整的长0.5-4mm，直径20-30μm，顶端细胞甚长，盘曲或折曲，的基部处为5-9个短小类方形细胞；另一有种非腺毛基部扁平，上部有7-8个细胞，每一个细胞长300-450μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-znn757x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-znn757x","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）禹州漏芦根横切面：后生皮层黄棕色。皮层细胞4-5列，切微延长，有分泌腔散在，内含棕色分泌物，内歧层细胞单列整齐。韧皮部有许多淡黄色纤维束散在，纤维细胞间隙内充满深棕色内含物。形成层成环。导和放射状排列，纤维束散在于薄壁组织中。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-h0k8pb0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-h0k8pb0","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-4lpw5t6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-4lpw5t6","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 临床有报道，过量服用漏芦发生中毒一例。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-brx1cxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-brx1cxp","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-sik46jv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-sik46jv","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.祁州漏芦 含挥发油。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-1fzy77g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-1fzy77g","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.华东蓝刺头 根含挥发油，已分离出24种成分：柠檬烯（limonene），薄荷酮（menthone），异薄荷酮（isomenthone），胡薄荷酮（pulegone），ξ-愈创木烯（ξ-guaiene），α-及β-檀香萜烯（santa-lene），葎草烯（humulene），表-β-檀香萜烯（epi-β-santalene），反式丁香烯（caryophyllene），α-香柑油烯（α-bergamotene），须式-β-金合欢烯（β-farnesene），丁香烯氧经物（caryophyllene oxide），苯并（1，2：5，4）联噻吩[benzo(1，2：5：，4)bithiophene]，6，10，14-三甲基-2-十五碳烯（6，10，14-TCMLIBimethyl-2-pentadecene），5-（3-丁烯-1-炔基）联噻吩[5-(3-buten-1-ynyl)bithiophene]，邻苯二甲酸二丁酯（dibutlphyhalate），十产烷酸（hexadecanoic acid），9，12-十八碳二烯酸甲酯（methyl9,12-octadecadienoate），9-十八碳烯酸甲酯（methyl 9-octdecenoate），9-12-十八碳二烯酸（9,12-octadeca-dienoic acid），α-三联噻吩（α-terthiophene）。还含5（4-O-异戊酰-1-炔基）联噻吩[5-(4-O-isopentanoylbutyn-1-yl)-2，2-bithio-phene]，异卡多帕亭（isocardopatine），卡多帕亭（cardopatine），5-（3，4-二羟基-1-丁炔基）-2，2-联噻吩[5-（3，4-dihydroxybutyn-1-yl）-2，2-bithiophene]。又含地榆糖甙（ziyulucoside）I，蒲公英赛醇乙酸酯（taraxerol acetate），熊果酸（ursonic acid），三十烷酸（TCMLIBiacon-tanoic acid）β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），胡萝卜甙（darcosterol）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ur2pjy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ur2pjy8","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.新疆蓝刺头 根含生物碱：卡多帕亭，异卡多帕亭。蓝刺头碱（echinopsine），蓝枣砂定碱（echinopsidine），蓝刺头胺（echinoramine），蓝刺头醚碱（echinorine）。又含三萜成分：α-香树脂醇（α-amyrin），α-香树脂醇乙酸酯（α-amyrin acetate），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），胡萝卜甙（daucosterol），冬青叶豚草酸（ilicic acid），木香酸（costic acid）。种子含蓝刺头宁碱（echinine）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-d9rs9yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-d9rs9yg","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-7s3h4kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-7s3h4kj","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.抗动脉粥样硬化的作用：1.1.对鹌鹑动脉粥样硬化的影响：用高脂饲料喂鹌鹑45天，70%发生动脉粥样硬化（As）病变，实验用鹌鹑72只，体重80-120g，随机分5组：（1）正常对照组5只。（2）高脂对照组20只。3）祁州漏芦小剂量组（祁州漏芦水煎剂，含生药0.18g）20只。（4）祁州漏芦大剂量组（祁州漏芦水煎剂，含生药1.8g）20只。（5）维生素E（VE）组10只。正常对照组吃普通饲料，其余用高脂饲料，用药组每天早晨ig给药，VE组每天早晨给油剂VE50mg，45日结束实验，颈动脉取血，在测定血脂和观察AS病变的同时，测走红细胞膜流动性和膜过氧化脂质（LPO）含量，结果，随着血浆胆固醇浓度升高，红细胞膜的微粘度和LPO含量也升高，都以高脂对照组为最，依次为VE组，祁州漏芦组和正常对照组，高脂对照组与后三组比较，微粘度和LPO含量的差异均有显着或非常显着意义。祁州漏芦组和VE组的胆固醇和微粘度分别与正常对照组比较及二组之间相互比较，差异均有非常显着意义(P\u003c0.01)，二组的 LPO含量与正常对照组及二组之间相互比较，差异无显着意义。VE组与高脂组的胆固醇水平相近，无显着差异。VE是一个已知生物抗氧化剂，能防止生物膜上不饱和脂肪酸过氧化，保护生物膜的完整，而祁州漏芦和VE一样，可降低血浆胆固醇水平，抑制红细胞膜的脂质过氧化，使AS病变减少减轻，提示抗氧化作用可能是祁州漏芦抗AS的机理之一。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-s7r9v82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-s7r9v82","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.2.对高血脂兔过氧化脂质代谢：与PGI2/TXA2平衡的影响实验用新西兰家兔，体重2kg左右，分为三组：（1）对照组8只，喂普通颗料饲料。（2）高脂组10只，每只每天先喂高脂饲料，吃完后补给普通饲料不限量，60天后恢复普通饲料喂养。（3）祁州漏芦组8只，同高脂组，但在高脂饲料中加入10ml祁州漏芦水煎剂（用生药25g煎得），实验进行95天，结束时颈动脉放血，解剖取材，进行血清胆固醇，血浆及动脉组织LPO，动脉壁SOD活性，PGI2、TXA2的稳定代谢产物6-酮-PGF1a TXB2。①血浆6-酮-PGF1a、TXB2含量。② 动脉组织6-酮-PGF1a、含量。③外源性花生四烯酸（AA）诱导动脉组产生6－酮－PGF1a、TXB2，以及血小板聚集率。结果用高脂饲料的同时加服祁州漏芦水煎剂可降低LPO含量，提高PGI2/TXA2比值，减轻AS病变，其作用机理可能与抗氧化作用有关。VE是一个已知生物抗氧化剂，能防止生物膜上不饱和脂肪酸过氧化，保护生物膜的完整，而祁州漏芦和VE一样，可降低血浆胆固醇水平，抑制红细胞膜的脂质过氧化，使AS病变减少减轻，提示抗氧化作用可能是祁州漏芦抗AS的机理之一。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-mvvfkg3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-mvvfkg3","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗氧化作用：2.1.不同提取部分分为，水提取后再经甲醇提取（Fl-1），70%乙醇提取（FI-3），甲醇提取后去鞣质（FI-4），甲醇提取后再经乙酸乙酯提取（FI-5），观察：2.1.1.对抗血卟啉衍生物（HpD）引起的光溶血结果：各提取部分中以FI-5作用最显着，在120mg生药/ml可完全对抗HpD引起的光溶血。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-tvmukp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-tvmukp4","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.2.对抗HpD合并照光引起的红细胞膜脂质过氧化作用：另外其水提液在体内外亦均有明显的对抗HpD的光氧化作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-o0t78za","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-o0t78za","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.3.对O2的清除作用：以下FI-5作用最显着。在5mg生药/ml，可完全清除。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-i1hxo2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-i1hxo2o","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.4.对抗H2O2引起的溶血：结果以FI-1作用最为显着。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-qrvu5jj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-qrvu5jj","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.5.对抗H2O2引起红细胞膜脂质过氧化作用：结果以FI-4作用最显着。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-k3z9mr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-k3z9mr7","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.6.对抗OH的作用：按文献方法产生OH，对照组甲醛产量24.0±2.6nmol/mlFI-I为21.9±2.4nmol/ml，无明显差别。其它各部分也无明显影响。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-9945qe2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-9945qe2","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.不同提取部分，分为水提取物、乙醇提取物。乙酸乙酯提取物观察：2.2.1.对大鼠肝、肾、大脑组织中脂质过氧化的抑制作用：按文献方法测定组织过氧化脂质的生成量。结果三种提取物均能显着抑制大鼠肝、肾、大脑匀浆中过氧化脂质的生成。其中以水提取物作用最强，乙醇提取物次之，余较弱。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-v0whimh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-v0whimh","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.2.对小鼠血浆SOD活性的影响：取昆明种小鼠，随机分5组，实验组每天 ig漏芦乙醇提取物30g/kg，15g/kg，水提物30g/kg、15g/kg，对照组用同体积生理盐水，连续15天，末次给药后15小时,摘眼取血，参照亚硝酸法测定血浆中SOD活性。结果乙醇提取物 30g/kg及水提取物30g/kg，15g/kg均能显着增强小鼠血浆中SOD活性。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-sy1tu6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-sy1tu6i","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.3.对小鼠红细胞内CAT活性的影响：实验参照上述方法，连续12d，末次取血后按文献方法测定CAT活性，结果，在此条件下，均未见明显活性。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-dhrucgf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-dhrucgf","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对组织脂质过氧化作用：3.1.对大鼠肝、脑、心、肾匀浆过氧化脂质生成的影响：参考文献方法制备各脏器匀浆，分别取各匀浆1.5ml，再分别加入漏芦根及地上部分水煎剂0.1ml（mg/ml），对照组用生理盐水，经常规处理后，在721分光光度计532nm波长下比色测定，以四乙氧基丙烷为标准，计算每g组织过氧化脂质生成量。结果根水煎剂1.563，0.625mg/ml和地上部分 0.781，0.313mg/ml剂量对各脏器过氧化脂质的生成均有显着抑制作用(P\u003c0.01)。且地上部分较根作用强。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-4qnkp5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-4qnkp5y","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.2.对小鼠血清过氧化脂质生成的影响：用体重16-18g小白鼠，各半，分成四组，一组每天ig 100%根水煎剂20g/kg，另一组每天ig地上部分水煎剂20g/kg，其余两组每天 ig等量生理盐水，连续15天，断头取血，制备血清。参考Yagidk.（1976）报道方法进行操作，最后测定荧光强度。激发光为513nm，发射光为533nm。结果根及地上部分ig给药均能显着抑制小鼠血清过氧化脂质的生成（P\u003c0.01)。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-cunh9zu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-cunh9zu","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.3.对小鼠肝匀浆、脑匀浆过氧化脂质生成的影响：取16-18g小白鼠，分成四组，一组每天ig 100%漏芦根水煎剂20g/kg，另一组每天ig漏芦地上部分水煎剂20g/kg，其余两组为对照组，分别ig等量生理盐水，连续给药15天后，l6天断头处死，取肝、脑，制成5%肝匀浆生理盐水溶液和5%脑匀浆生理盐水溶液，参考文献方法，用721分光光度计在532nm波长下比色测定，以四乙氧基丙烷为标准，计算每克组织氧化脂质的生成量。结果漏芦根及地上部分除可显着抑制小鼠肝匀浆过氧化脂质的生成外，其地上部分尚可显着抑制小鼠脑匀浆过氧化脂质的生成。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-eyqn2y4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-eyqn2y4","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.4.漏芦蜕皮甾酮对培养主动脉平滑肌细胞的作用：从祁州漏芦根中提取漏芦蜕皮甾酮（RUE）进行实验，以维生素E作对照，观察其对细胞的影响。高脂血清（HLS）含β-脂蛋白3480mg/1天，实验用2%浓度。3H－胸腺嘧啶核苷（3H-TdR），放射比活性22ci/mmol，放化纯度90%。主动脉平滑肌细胞（SMC）的培养，取家兔主动脉中膜，剪成1mm小块作贴壁式培养，按常规方法传代，采用第16-18代细胞。每份样品含细胞4-6×105观察3.4.1.RUE对SMC摄取3H-TdR的影响：结果无论是正常血清（CS）组或HLS组，培养液中加入RUE50ug/ml后，SMC的标记率均升高，与未加RUE的相应对照组比较差别显着（P\u003c0.05）。CS培养液中加RUE50ug/ml培养，细胞内LPO含量比未加者明显下降。HLS 组LPO均值明显高于CS组（P\u003c0.05）。HLS培养液中加RUE5、25、50ug/ml，SMC的 LPO含量依次下降，25与50ug组与HLS对照组比较均有显着差别。此作用与RUE剂量平行，剂量越大效果越明显。RUE25-50um/ml能使LPO降低到CS培养中的水平，有利于SMC的生长代谢。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-0yrzf3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-0yrzf3u","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.4.2.RUE（50ug/ml）与VE（80ug/ml）作用的比较：RUE与VE均对SMC有进一步促其 摄3H-TdR的作用，但二者之间的差别元统计学意义。HLS 组 LPO含量明显高于CS组，加 RUE与VE后，LPO含量明显下降，均有统计意义。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-7jom8q2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-7jom8q2","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.4.3.RUE与VE对SMC超微结构的影响：用2%HLS增养的 SMC胞浆中有较多脂滴，直径0.2-0.7u，胞膜下有多量吞饮小泡。加RUE5oug/ml培养的SMC中脂滴与吞饮小泡明显减少，脂滴缩小，溶酶体数量增多，核染色质丰富。VE组（含VE80ug/ml）SMC形态与RUE组相似。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-2jw4q4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-2jw4q4w","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.对大鼠B型单胺氧化酶活性的抑制作用：采用Wistar 大鼠，体重200-250g，祁州漏芦用70%乙醇提取。大鼠大脑线粒体B型单胺氧化酶（MAO-B）的制备，参照kan和Benedelti（1981）方法。脑 MAO-B的活性测定，参照Mcewen（1971）方法，并加以修改。肝MAO-B制备，参照Tanaka等（1989）方法肝 MAO－B活性测定，参照Takeuchi等（1973）方法观察：4.1.漏芦乙醇提取物对MAO-B的抑制作用：取不同剂量的漏芦乙醇提取物加入反应体系中，以不加漏芦的酶活性为100%。结果表明，漏芦对大脑及肝MAO-B活性均呈显着的剂量依赖性抑制作用。对肝MAO-B活性的抑制作用较弱，仅为脑的50%左右。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-5gyvqek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-5gyvqek","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.2.漏芦乙醇提取物对MAO-B活性的抑制特征：通过对不同底物浓度下漏芦乙醇提取物对MAO-B活性抑制的动力学研究表明，漏芦对大鼠大脑、肝线粒体 MAO-B活性的抑制作用均属于竞争性抑制。人脑中MAO-B活性在45岁以后随年龄增长而急剧增加。从而上引起脑内儿茶酚胺代谢紊乱，生理活性失调。MAO-B可间接反映生物体老化程度，故又称老化相关酶。因此，寻找效率高、副作用小的MAO-B抑制剂，对延缓衰老、防治老年性疾病有着重要的意义。实验观察到，漏芦乙醇提取物能显着地抑制大鼠大脑线粒体中MAO-B活性，从而可以减缓 MAO-B对体内单胺类神经介质和激素的灭活作用，延长这些神经介质和激素的生理效应，调节中央衰老钟的运行，因此以上实验对漏芦用于老年病的防治和延缓衰老提供了一定的实验依据。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-2itry9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-2itry9t","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.对动物免疫作用的影响：5.1. 祁州漏芦蜕皮甾酮对小鼠末梢血淋巴细胞ANAE阳性率的影响：小鼠19 -22g，漏芦蜕皮甾酮20mg/kg，ig每日1次，给药前测第1次指标，连续给药10天后，测第2次指标。然后按100mg/kg剂量1次ip环磷酰胺，并继续给药，每日1次，于注射环磷酰胺后4天，测第3次指标，7天测第4次指标，l4天和21天测最后二次指标。结果：连续给蜕皮甾酮 10天后ANAE（＋）淋巴细胞的比值和绝对数均有显着提高，由60.45±1.37%提高到73.20±3.52%（t=11.14，P\u003c0.001)。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ox2btci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ox2btci","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.2.祁州漏芦蜕皮甾酮对环磷酰胺免疫抑制作用的影响：小鼠注射环磷酰胺d7，蜕皮甾酮组的ANAE（＋）淋巴细胞的比值下降，至l4天最低值为56.5±8.8，但仍维持在正常范围，未出现ANAE（＋）、（一）淋巴细胞的倒置现象。给药组的ANAE（＋）淋巴细胞比值各次测得的结果均高于对照组，统计处理（t检验）有显着性差异。结果表明漏芦蜕皮甾酮对环磷酰胺所引起的小鼠末梢血淋巴细胞ANAE阳性率的降低有一定的预防和治疗作用，对白细胞总数的变化似无明显影响。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-iwmddl5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-iwmddl5","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.3.祁州漏芦对IL-2的影响：IL-2在晚期癌症治疗中效果良好，但在体内给于大剂量的rIL-2不仅价格昂贵，而且还有严重副作用。实验表明，祁州漏芦可显着增强大鼠脾细胞在conA刺激下产生IL-2的能力，且不影响血清IL-2抑制因子水平。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-8tswdor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-8tswdor","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-re7cwjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-re7cwjn","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，去毛，洗净，润透，切片晒干。《雷公炮炙论》：凡使漏芦，细锉，拌生甘草相对蒸，从巳至中，去甘草净拣用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-75daxl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-75daxl3","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-14iyjxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-14iyjxh","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 （1）取祁州漏芦醇溶液（1g/ml）1ml，加1%三氯化铁试液1滴，产生黄棕色沉淀。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-zxf7vqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-zxf7vqk","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)取祁州漏芦醇溶液1滴于滤纸上，在紫外光灯下观察，显亮蓝色荧光，再滴加三氯化铁试液1滴，呈黄绿色，荧光消失。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ag3fgvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ag3fgvc","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-tk0gzr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-tk0gzr2","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归胃；大肠；肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-irmayvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-irmayvc","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-jkhothl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-jkhothl","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；性寒"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-ih8hsni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-ih8hsni","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-eiqttju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-eiqttju","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 气虚、疮疡平塌不起及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-yt4qvyh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-yt4qvyh","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《日华子本草》：连翘为使。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-34nilx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-34nilx0","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：疮疡阴症，平塌不起发者，非所宜投。妊娠禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-eanczi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-eanczi5","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《得配本草》：气虚者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-nrg5abn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-nrg5abn","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-o65r3l1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-o65r3l1","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 清热解毒；活血通乳。主疮疖肿毒；乳痈；肋腺炎；淋马结结核；痔瘘；疥癣痒疹；目赤肿痛；痢疾；蛔早腹痛；风湿痹痛；闪腰岔气；跌打损伤；产后乳汁不下"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-x5y6kbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-x5y6kbk","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-qfyfx8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-qfyfx8i","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，9-15g。外用：适量，研末醋调敷；或鲜品捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-a87h5g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-a87h5g7","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-uzr5q2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-uzr5q2d","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疽作二日后，退毒下脓：黄芪(生用)、连翘各一两，大黄一分(微炒)，漏芦一两(有白茸者)，甘草半两(生用)，沉香一两。上为末，姜、枣汤调下。(《集验背疽方》漏芦汤)②治乳妇气脉壅塞，乳汁不行，及经给凝滞，乳内胀痛，留蓄邪毒，或作痈肿：漏芦二两半，瓜萎十个(急火烧焦存性)，蛇蜕十条(炙)。上为细散，每服二钱，温酒调服，不拘时，良久吃热羹汤助之。(《局方》漏芦散)②治瘰疬，排脓、止痛、生肌：漏芦、连翘、紫花地丁、贝母、金银花、甘草、夏枯草各等分。水煎服。(《本草汇言》)④治皮肤瘙痒，阴疹，风毒，疮疥：漏芦、荆芥、白鲜皮、浮萍、牛膝、当归、蕲蛇、枸杞子各一两，甘草六钱，苦参二两。浸酒蒸次。(《本草汇言》)⑤治流行性腮腺炎：板蓝根一钱，漏芦一钱半，牛蒡子四分，甘草五分。水煎服。(《新疆中草药手册》)⑥治历节风，筋脉拘挛，骨节疼痛：漏芦半两(去芦头，麸炒)，地龙(去土，炒)半两。上二味捣罗为末。先用生姜二两取汁，蜜二两，同煎三、五沸，入好酒五合，以瓷器盛。每用七分盏调药末一钱半匕，温服不拘时。(《圣济总录》古圣散)⑦治小儿无辜疳痢，羸弱，不欲饮食，及腹内虫动作，多吐清水：漏芦二两，猪肝一两，楮树根白皮一两(锉)。上药，捣罗为末，炼蜜和捣一、二百杵丸如弹子大。每服以温水研一丸，不计时候，量儿大小，分减服之。(《圣惠方》漏芦丸)⑧治冷劳泄痢，及妇人产后带下诸疾：漏芦(去芦头)一两，艾叶(去梗炒)四两。上二味，捣罗为末，用米醋三升，入药末一半，先熬成膏，后入余药和丸如梧桐子大。每服三十丸，温米饮下，食前服。(《圣济总录》漏芦丸)⑨治室女月水不调：漏芦(去芦头)、当归(切，焙)、红花子、枳壳(去瓤，麸炒)、白茯苓(去黑皮)、人参各半两。上六味，粗捣筛，每服三钱匕，水一盏，煎七分，去滓。温服，不拘时。(《圣济总录》漏芦汤)⑩治白秃：五月收漏芦草，烧作灰，膏和使涂之，先用盐汤洗，乃敷。(《补缺肘后方》)"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-6qzg085","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-6qzg085","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-glogxt4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-glogxt4","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《纲目》：漏芦，下乳汁、消热毒、排脓、止血、生肌、杀虫，故东垣以为手、足阳明药，而古方治痈疽发背，以漏芦汤为首称也。庞安常《伤寒论》治痈疽及预解时行痘疹热，用漏芦叶，云无则以山栀子代之，亦取其寒能解热，盖不知其能入阳明之故也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-8ajsccy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-8ajsccy","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：漏芦，苦能下泄，咸能软坚，寒能除热，寒而通利之药也。故主皮肤热，恶疮疽痔，湿痹，下乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-bjqiq58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-bjqiq58","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本经逢原》：漏芦，《本经》治热毒恶疮，下乳汁，以其能利窍也，为消毒排脓杀虫要药。盖咸能软坚，寒能解毒，故服之必大便作泻，使邪从下而出也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-zg2kz1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-zg2kz1d","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草求真》：漏芦，遗精尿血能止，亦因毒解热除自止之意，非因漏芦寓有收涩之功也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-8b7cig8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-8b7cig8","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本经续疏》：漏芦，《本经》谓其下乳汁，《别录》谓其止遗溺，旨实相反，何欤?夫溺以温化而通，乳以清纯而下。遗溺固乎热，乳不下亦因乎热，非有二也。惟其利水由于除热，是以能使不应行者归于应行，而应行者不得应行而不行，则漏芦者谓为疡证逐湿之剂可也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-dn5x1rd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-dn5x1rd","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草正义》：漏芦，滑利泄热，与王不留行功用最近，而寒苦直泄，尤其过之。苟非实热，不可轻用。不独耗阴，尤损正气。《日华》谓通小肠，治泄精溺血，肠风乳痈，排脓止痛，通经脉，皆惟实热之症，可以暂用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-e53hu0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-e53hu0c","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本经》：主皮肤热，恶疮疽痔，湿痹，下乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-unr7c1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-unr7c1a","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《别录》：止遗溺，热气疮痒如麻豆，可作浴汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-3p916pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-3p916pd","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.陶弘景：疗谐瘘疥。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-zuu52y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-zuu52y6","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《药性论》：治身上热毒风生恶疮，皮肌瘙痒瘾疹。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-hvnmglr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-hvnmglr","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草拾遗》：杀虫，洗疮疥用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-19kq2kr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-19kq2kr","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《日华子本草》：治小儿壮热，通小肠，(治)泄精，尿血，风赤眼，乳痈，发背，瘰疬，肠风，排脓，补血，治扑损，续筋骨，敷金疮，止血长肉，通经脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-yicxn81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-yicxn81","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《山西中药志》：清热凉血，治热毒血痢，血衄.血痔，温疫等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-cvsf887","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-cvsf887","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607124312-etmet1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124312-etmet1m","updated":"20240607124312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607124313-94bgye8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607124313-94bgye8"}},{"ID":"20240607124314-f857she","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607124314-f857she"}}]}